    "notes": [
      "The missiles are launched from an offset 25 units in front of Cho'Gath and towards the target's location on-attack-complete.\n  - When attacking enemies within 25 units center-to-center of Cho'Gath, the missile will fire in the opposite direction.",
      "Cho'Gath's size factors into the wideness of the hitbox Vorpal Spikes has. External size modifiers (Wild Growth) contribute to this.\n  - At certain size thresholds, the missile gets replaced by a different one with a different width. At each step, the width grows by 30, except for the 3rd missile, where it only grows by 10.\n  - Some of the size thresholds are placed very weird.\n  - The missile range is unchanged.",
      "The empowered attack will trigger but not apply its effects against structures."
